Package: uftp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: encrypted UDP based file transfer with multicast
 UFTP sends files to many receivers at the same time over IP multicast,
 and encrypts the transfer by default. This package contains the uftp
 sender, the uftpd receiver, the uftpproxyd proxy and the uftp_keymgt
 key tool. It installs no service: uftpd runs only when it is started.
 .
 This is UFTP 5, which does not work with UFTP 4 senders or receivers.
